                    This record stays connected to the AI actor
                    as its technical environment changes.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>


      {/* =====================================================
          WHAT ACTOR / REPRESENTATION / PASSPORT MEAN
          ===================================================== */}

                  <section className={styles.coreSection}>
        <div className={styles.shell}>
          <div className={styles.coreIntro}>
            <p className={styles.goldEyebrow}>
              THE CORE IDEA
            </p>

            <h2>
              Determine which AI actor is behind the activity.
            </h2>

            <p>
              AIGO-OS uses information from connected systems to
              understand which technical identities, workloads and
              systems relate to the same AI actor.
